{% psec 1, "Which Tankers Are Carrying Oil Right Now?", "The live map, updated by itself every hour or so", "Live map" %}
<p class="topic-intro">
  Every big ship broadcasts a radio signal saying who it is, where it is and how deep it's sitting in the water. This page listens to those signals in the English Channel and the southern North Sea, picks out the crude oil tankers, and works out which ones are <strong>full</strong> and which are sailing <strong>empty</strong>.
</p>

